<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>2025-2026 온열질환 및 사망자 추이 심층 분석 리포트</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts (Noto Sans KR) -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .gradient-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9) 100%);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .alert-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.4) 0%, rgba(69, 10, 10, 0.6) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }
        .accent-glow-red {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen pb-16">

    <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <span class="inline-block w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-ping"></span>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400 bg-red-950/60 border border-red-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">하절기 기후재난 분석 리포트</span>
                <h1 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 hidden md:block">| 온열질환 및 사망자 비교 (2025 vs 2026)</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                발행일: <span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">2026년 8월 기준 데이터</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 space-y-8">

        <!-- Banner / Title Section -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
                        폭염 피크 지연과 압축적 극단성 분석
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">
                        2025년 대비 2026년 하절기 폭염 영향 패턴 변화 및 인명 피해 집중 분석
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-300">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
                    <span>분석 요약: 8월 집중 폭염으로 사망자 급증</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Headline Insight Banner Box -->
        <section class="alert-card accent-glow-red rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 text-red-500 pointer-events-none">
                <svg class="w-64 h-64" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.395 2.553a1 1 0 00-1.45-1.348l-8 8a1 1 0 001.45 1.348l8-8zm-5.69 13.106a1 1 0 001.45 1.348l8-8a1 1 0 00-1.45-1.348l-8 8z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="relative z-10 space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-red-400 font-bold text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                    <span>핵심 분석 요약 (Headline Insight)</span>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-red-100 leading-relaxed">
                    "2026년 온열질환자 수는 <span class="text-emerald-400">10.3% 감소</span>했으나, 폭염 피크 시기가 7월에서 8월로 지연·집중되면서 하절기 사망자 수는 오히려 <span class="text-red-400 underline decoration-red-500 decoration-2 underline-offset-4">40.9% 급증</span>하였습니다."
                </blockquote>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- KPI Metrics Grid -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
            <!-- Card 1: Patients -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400 text-sm">
                    <span>총 온열질환자</span>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-800">▼ 10.3%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">3,219</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">명</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 pt-2 flex justify-between">
                    <span>2025년 기준:</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">3,589명</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Deaths -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3 border-l-4 border-l-red-500">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400 text-sm">
                    <span>총 사망자 수</span>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-red-950 text-red-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-800">▲ 40.9%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-400">31</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">명</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 pt-2 flex justify-between">
                    <span>2025년 기준:</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">22명</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: Fatal Rate -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400 text-sm">
                    <span>치명률 (Fatality Rate)</span>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-amber-950 text-amber-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-800">▲ 57.4% 증가</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-400">0.96</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 pt-2 flex justify-between">
                    <span>2025년 기준:</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">0.61%</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4: August Deaths YoY -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3 border-l-4 border-l-purple-500">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400 text-sm">
                    <span>8월 사망자 수</span>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-purple-950 text-purple-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-purple-800">▲ 220% 폭증</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-baseline space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-purple-300">16</span>
                    <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">명</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 pt-2 flex justify-between">
                    <span>2025년 8월 기준:</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">5명</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Charts Section -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <!-- Monthly Distribution Chart -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
                        월별 온열질환자 발생 추이 (7월 vs 8월)
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">단위: 명</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-64 relative">
                    <canvas id="monthlyPatientsChart"></canvas>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                    💡 <strong class="text-slate-200">피크 이동:</strong> 2025년은 7월에 전체 환자의 69.3%(2,486명)가 집중되었으나, 2026년은 폭염 도래가 지연되며 8월 환자가 54.6%(1,759명)를 차지, 전년 동기 대비 <span class="text-amber-400">91.6% 폭증</span>했습니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Fatalities Comparison Chart -->
            <div class="gradient-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                        월별 사망자 발생 추이 및 치명률
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">단위: 명</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-64 relative">
                    <canvas id="monthlyDeathsChart"></canvas>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                    💡 <strong class="text-slate-200">위험도 증대:</strong> 환자 발생 피크가 8월로 이행되면서 8월 사망자가 5명에서 16명으로 <span class="text-red-400">3배 이상(+220%) 폭증</span>하여 중증도 위험이 가중되었습니다.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Extremes & Intensive Period Deep Dive -->
        <section class="gradient-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-6 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                        극단적 위험 수치 및 피크 기간 비교 분석 (Extremes)
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">단기 극단 폭염이 의료 및 방역체계에 미친 과부하 요인</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                <!-- Extreme 1 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">일일 최다 환자 발생</div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">239</span><span class="text-xs text-slate-400"> 명</span>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-400 mt-0.5">2026년 8월 7일</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right border-l border-slate-800 pl-3">
                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">259명</span>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">2025년 7월 8일</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/60">
                        피크 일일 환자 수 자체는 유사하나, 발생 시점이 7월 초에서 8월 중순으로 한 달가량 이동함.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Extreme 2 -->
                <div class="bg-red-950/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-red-900/50 space-y-2">
                    <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-400">일일 최다 사망자 (기록적 참사)</div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-400">5</span><span class="text-xs text-red-300"> 명/일</span>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-red-300 mt-0.5">2026년 8월 8일</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right border-l border-red-900/50 pl-3">
                            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400">최대 2명/일</span>
                            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">2025년 하절기</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-red-300/80 pt-2 border-t border-red-900/40">
                        2025년에는 일 사망자가 최대 2명 수준이었으나, 2026년 8월 8일 하루에만 5명 사망 참사 발생.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Extreme 3 -->
                <div class="bg-amber-950/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-amber-900/50 space-y-2">
                    <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">최밀집 6일 간 집중 피해</div>
                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">기간:</span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300">2026.08.03 ~ 08.08 (6일간)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">누적 환자:</span>
                            <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-white">1,249명 <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">(전체 38.8%)</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">누적 사망자:</span>
                            <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-red-400">14명 <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-normal">(전체 45.2%)</span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-200/80 pt-2 border-t border-amber-900/40">
                        단 6일 동안 2026년 전체 사망자의 절반에 가까운 14명 사망, 응급의료체계 극심한 과부하 초래.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Summary & Strategic Policy Takeaways -->
        <section class="gradient-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                종합 분석 시사점 및 정책 대응 제언
            </h3>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
                <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">1. 위험 형태의 변화 (지연형 압축 폭염)</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        환자 발생 총량 감소에 착시를 일으키지 않아야 함. 피크 기간이 7월에서 8월로 지연·압축되면서 열 스트레스가 신체 누적된 상태에서 극단적 온도가 가해져 치명률이 <strong>57.4% 상승</strong>했음을 반영.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-red-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">2. 8월 초 응급의료 및 방역 비상체계 재편</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        8월 3일~8일과 같이 단 6일 동안 전체 사망자의 45.2%가 유입되는 초집중형 기후재난에 대비해, 8월 초순 응급실 병상 확보 및 취약계층 intensive 모니터링 집중 자원 투입이 필수적임.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-12 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-6">
        <p>2025-2026 하절기 온열질환 모니터링 및 사망 데이터 통합 분석 보고서 | Data Source: 온열질환 응급실감시체계 통계 기반</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Chart Configuration Script -->
    <script>
        // Chart text styling
        Chart.defaults.color = '#94a3b8';
        Chart.defaults.font.family = "'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif";

        // 1. Monthly Patients Chart
        const ctxPatients = document.getElementById('monthlyPatientsChart').getContext('2d');
        new Chart(ctxPatients, {
            type: 'bar',
            data: {
                labels: ['7월', '8월'],
                datasets: [
                    {
                        label: '2025년 환자 수',
                        data: [2486, 918],
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.7)',
                        borderColor: 'rgba(59, 130, 246, 1)',
                        borderWidth: 1,
                        borderRadius: 6
                    },
                    {
                        label: '2026년 환자 수',
                        data: [1460, 1759], // 3219 - 1759 = 1460 (7월)
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8)',
                        borderColor: 'rgba(245, 158, 11, 1)',
                        borderWidth: 1,
                        borderRadius: 6
                    }
                ]
            },
            options: {
                responsive: true,
                maintainAspectRatio: false,
                plugins: {
                    legend: {
                        position: 'top',
                        labels: { boxWidth: 12, padding: 15 }
                    },
                    tooltip: {
                        callbacks: {
                            label: function(context) {
                                return `${context.dataset.label}: ${context.raw.toLocaleString()}명`;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                scales: {
                    y: {
                        beginAtZero: true,
                        grid: { color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)' }
                    },
                    x: {
                        grid: { display: false }
                    }
                }
            }
        });

        // 2. Monthly Deaths Chart
        const ctxDeaths = document.getElementById('monthlyDeathsChart').getContext('2d');
        new Chart(ctxDeaths, {
            type: 'bar',
            data: {
                labels: ['7월 사망자', '8월 사망자'],
                datasets: [
                    {
                        label: '2025년 사망자',
                        data: [16, 5],
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.6)',
                        borderColor: 'rgba(148, 163, 184, 1)',
                        borderWidth: 1,
                        borderRadius: 6
                    },
                    {
                        label: '2026년 사망자',
                        data: [15, 16], // 31 - 16 = 15
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.85)',
                        borderColor: 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 1)',
                        borderWidth: 1,
                        borderRadius: 6
                    }
                ]
            },
            options: {
                responsive: true,
                maintainAspectRatio: false,
                plugins: {
                    legend: {
                        position: 'top',
                        labels: { boxWidth: 12, padding: 15 }
                    },
                    tooltip: {
                        callbacks: {
                            label: function(context) {
                                return `${context.dataset.label}: ${context.raw}명`;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                scales: {
                    y: {
                        beginAtZero: true,
                        ticks: { stepSize: 5 },
                        grid: { color: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)' }
                    },
                    x: {
                        grid: { display: false }
                    }
                }
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
